  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I get that waiting 24 hours isn't ideal with guests on the way. I can't speed up the incident team's response, but your case is filed and you don't need to do anything else for #6601.\n\n**Order #6602 (Spice Route):** You placed this at 7:02 pm, which is just after the recall window, so I could handle it myself. You were charged for 2 garlic naans and only 1 arrived. I've refunded **$4.00** to your Visa ending 4242. It should show up within 3\u20135 business days.\n\nI didn't see any curry dishes in #6602 (just the naan and a mango lassi), so the recall doesn't affect anything in this order.\n\nWhat went wrong with #6603 from Lotus Garden?"
