  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've checked #6603 from Lotus Garden. They have no open incidents, and the spring rolls ($7.00) are on your order with nothing refunded for them yet, so I can take care of this now. You have two options:\n\n1. **A $7.00 refund** to your Visa ending 4242. It arrives in 3\u20135 business days.\n2. **$8.40 in Forkful account credit**, which is the item price plus 20%. It's available right away on your next order.\n\nWhich one would you like?"
